      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Folio 1v (sixth section in join)",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>\n<p>except her, neither male nor female. And at that time</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>the kings refused to marry his girl, and he yearned to see</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>her with a male child, who would be like a son and a descendant to him, even (if he were) from his daughter.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>So he said to them: \u201cEverything that you mentioned I have no need for\u2014neither that the</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>sick be healed, nor that the dying will live, nor that the living would die, nor making rain fall,</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>nor making plants grow. But one benefit of those you mentioned I do want.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>I have a virgin daughter whom no one has seen. Can you have a</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>child come from her without (her) being with a man?\u201d And Yeshu said: \u201cYes, oh king, if only</p>\n</li>\n<li>you will show her in our presence.\u201d He did so and brought her. And he (Yeshu) performed a miracle</li>\n<li>\n<p>by magic and she became pregnant. Then they arrested him until the end of nine months</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>to see what will be of the maiden. And the maiden spent nine months...</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>great... and extreme distress.\u00a0When Yehoshu\u02bfa ben Perah\u0323iah</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>saw this he wrote to all the towns, to Israel (i.e., to the Jews), that they should fast for three days and pr[ay]</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>and ask God that He would annul Yeshu\u2019s act and his planning and his invocations.\u00a0</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>And God, the Exalted, the Majestic, did as is his custom to act kindly in every per[iod]</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>with the sons of Israel, and he transformed the foetus and it turned to stone. When</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>nine months had passed, the maiden did not give birth and her pains increased. And Yeshu was brought,</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>and the king said to him: \u201cWhy didn\u2019t the maiden give birth as you had claimed?\u201d And Yeshu said: </p>\n</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
